Modifiers that hear another track (Segno: docs/design/modulators.md §12.4, the Follower's Listen).

A modifier processed before a plugin (the custom-modifiers patch) may name a track to hear
(Modifier::getSidechainSourceID), as a plugin's sidechain does: that track then sends its sound,
after its plugins, on a sidechain bus, and the modifier's node takes it on two channels after the
track's own two. Only the track's own two go on down the chain. With none named, nothing changes.

